4. PERMISSION INHERITANCE
==================================================

Permissions must support hierarchical inheritance.

Example:

Stefan = Editor
at Knowledge Base level

Then Stefan should inherit Editor access to the hierarchy nodes and articles underneath that Knowledge Base.

Similarly:

Sean = Editor
at IT Support hierarchy level

Then Sean should inherit that permission for articles underneath IT Support.

An article can also have a direct user permission.

Example:

Article: VPN Troubleshooting

John Sweet = Editor directly on this article.

The system must distinguish:

1. Inherited permission
2. Direct permission
3. Effective permission

Implement inheritance in the shared authorization/service layer.

Do NOT implement inheritance separately inside individual React pages.

